                [
                    'type' => 'text',
                    'title' => 'Zero CMS Architectural Trade-offs',
                    'content' => '<p>Every engineering choice is a compromise. Zero CMS is optimized for speed, security, and zero-dependency longevity. However, these optimizations impose strict boundaries. This page details the limitations and constraints of Zero CMS so developers can make informed architectural decisions.</p>',
