                    'title' => 'Creating Middleware Filters',
                    'content' => '<p>Middlewares act as HTTP request-filters. They reside under <code>src/Middleware/</code> or <code>src/Http/Middleware/</code> (such as <code>AuthMiddleware</code> to guard dashboards, and <code>CsrfMiddleware</code> to protect POST form submissions) and operate using a decoupled onion-style handler pipeline.</p>',
