                    'content' => '<p>To preserve absolute zero-dependency performance, Zero CMS rejects massive outbound mailer libraries (such as PHPMailer or curl-based APIs) in favor of a <strong>native TCP socket emailing handshake</strong> nested inside <code>src/Support/Emailer.php</code>.</p>',
