                [
                    'type' => 'text',
                    'title' => 'ActiveRecord Query Isolation via Traits',
                    'content' => '<p>Rather than relying on developers to manually write <code>WHERE site_id = ?</code> on every query, the core ActiveRecord trait (<code>IsModel</code>) automatically appends the active tenant site boundaries behind the scenes on all queries:</p><pre><code class="language-php">// Inside src/Models/Traits/IsModel.php

