                    'type' => 'text',
                    'title' => 'The Community Forum Module',
                    'content' => '<p>Zero CMS features an integrated, high-contrast, fully localized and multi-tenant Community Forum module. It allows multiple tenants to host self-contained discussions, categorizing topics into Boards, managing conversations through Threads, and tracking user replies cleanly.</p>',
